> FUNCTION: Build Member Outreach List   TYPE: EXCEXTFUN
> FILE:     Member Eligibility           MODEL: CLMMDL
> PURPOSE:  List members whose coverage ends within the outreach window.
>
> PARAMETERS
>   I  Window Days               WNDAYS
>   O  Members Written           MBRCNT
>
.-
.  WRK.Window End Date = JOB.*Job date + PAR.Window Days *DAYS
.  PAR.Members Written = CON.0
.-
.-REPEAT
.|  Member Eligibility    *  RTVOBJ  Read Next Member
.|  .  Member ID          O  LCL.Member ID
.|  .  Plan ID            O  LCL.Plan ID
.|  .  Termination Date   O  LCL.Termination Date
.|-CASE
.||-PGM.*Return code is *Record does not exist
.||  <-- *QUIT
.|'-ENDCASE
.|-CASE
.||-LCL.Termination Date is GE JOB.*Job date
.||  AND LCL.Termination Date is LE WRK.Window End Date
.||  Member Outreach       *  CRTOBJ  Add Outreach Entry
.||  .  Member ID          I  LCL.Member ID
.||  .  Plan ID            I  LCL.Plan ID
.||  .  Termination Date   I  LCL.Termination Date
.||  PAR.Members Written = PAR.Members Written + CON.1
.|'-ENDCASE
.'-ENDREPEAT
